<div class="tsp-pro"><div class="act-light">
<section class="sec qi-hero" id="charge">
    <figure class="qi-visual" id="qivis">
      <div class="qi-overlay" id="qiovl">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--act)">Qi2.2 無線快充</p>
        <h2 class="qi-title" style="color:#f5f5f7"><b>25W</b>，<span style="white-space:nowrap">快得有分寸。</span></h2>
        <p class="lede qi-intro" style="max-width:none;color:rgba(245,245,247,.82)">磁吸精準定位、動態控溫與異物偵測，讓高速充電穩定維持，而不是一熱就停。</p>
      </div>
      <img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-qi-speed.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="穩如鈦山 Pro 25W 無線快充">
    </figure>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="qi-stage" aria-label="Qi2.2 快充效能摘要">
        <div class="qi-power">
          <span class="qi-power-label">Qi2.2 磁吸快充</span>
          <div class="qi-big">25<small>W</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="qi-proof">
          <div class="qi-proof-item"><strong>1.67×</strong><span>相較一般 15W Qi2<br>更高充電功率</span></div>
          <div class="qi-proof-item"><strong>30 分鐘</strong><span>充至約 50%<br>快速補回日常所需</span></div>
          <div class="qi-proof-item"><strong>WPC</strong><span>官方 Qi2.2 認證<br>效率與相容性有依據</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cardrow cardrow--light" style="margin-top:44px">
        <div>
          <div class="ccard-fig"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z"/></svg></div>
          <p class="ccard-cap"><b>動態功率調節</b>即時監測溫度、電流、電壓，隨時走在最快又不過熱的那條線上。</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="ccard-fig"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></div>
          <p class="ccard-cap"><b>磁吸定位更準</b>線圈對得準，能量才不會變熱能——減少偏移充電的損耗。</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="ccard-fig"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg></div>
          <p class="ccard-cap"><b>FOD 異物偵測更靈敏</b>鑰匙、硬幣放上去，立刻降低或停止輸出。</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="ccard-fig"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 1 0 3-6.3"/><path d="M4 4v5h5"/></svg></div>
          <p class="ccard-cap"><b>不斷充</b>過熱時降功率續充，告別「充充停停」的舊無線充電。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" style="padding-top:30px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--act)">充電效能</p>
        <h2 class="chg-big">30 分鐘，充到 <b>50%</b>。</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:none">瓦數要快，散熱也要跟得上——散熱不足的 25W，高溫降載後反而跑輸 15W。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="chgchart" id="chgchart">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 680 360" role="img" aria-label="25W 與一般 15W 無線充電的電量曲線比較：30 分鐘時 25W 約 50%、15W 約 30%">
          <g stroke="rgba(0,0,0,.07)" stroke-width="1">
            <line x1="70" y1="60" x2="620" y2="60"/><line x1="70" y1="180" x2="620" y2="180"/>
            <line x1="70" y1="300" x2="620" y2="300"/>
          </g>
          <g fill="#6e6e73" font-size="12" text-anchor="end">
            <text x="60" y="64">70%</text><text x="60" y="184">35%</text><text x="60" y="304">0%</text>
          </g>
          <line x1="620" y1="60" x2="620" y2="300" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,.12)" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
          <text x="620" y="324" fill="#6e6e73" font-size="12" text-anchor="end">30 分鐘</text>
          <text x="70" y="324" fill="#6e6e73" font-size="12">0</text>
          <path class="ar" d="M70,300 C260,266 450,229 620,197 L620,300 Z" fill="rgba(155,155,161,.10)"/>
          <path class="ln" d="M70,300 C260,266 450,229 620,197" stroke="#9b9ba1"/>
          <path class="ar" d="M70,300 C255,234 445,172 620,129 L620,300 Z" fill="rgba(0,113,227,.10)"/>
          <path class="ln" d="M70,300 C255,234 445,172 620,129" stroke="#0071e3"/>
          <path class="ln" fill="none" stroke="#b08978" stroke-width="2" d="M70,300 C150,240 230,190 320,180 C440,168 545,192 620,214"/>
          <g class="ar">
            <circle cx="620" cy="214" r="5" fill="#b08978" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="620" cy="129" r="6" fill="#0071e3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="606" y="113" fill="#0071e3" font-size="22" font-weight="800" text-anchor="end">50%</text>
            <circle cx="620" cy="197" r="5" fill="#9b9ba1" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="606" y="188" fill="#6e6e73" font-size="14" font-weight="600" text-anchor="end">約 30%</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <div class="chg-legend"><span><i style="background:#0071e3"></i>穩如鈦山 Pro 25W<em style="color:#0071e3">50%</em></span><span><i style="background:#9b9ba1"></i>一般 Qi2 15W<em style="color:#6e6e73">約 30%</em></span><span><i style="background:#b08978"></i>散熱不足的 25W（示意）<em style="color:#8f7060">約 25%</em></span></div>
        <div class="chg-more">
          <button type="button" id="chgmorebtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="chgmoretxt"><i>＋</i>數據說明</button>
          <p class="chgnote" id="chgmoretxt" hidden>30 分鐘 50% 為無線充電實測；曲線為示意，實際依手機機型與環境而異。「散熱不足的 25W」為原理示意：高溫觸發降載後，實際功率會低於標示瓦數。</p>
        </div>
        
      </div>

      <div class="times" id="times">
        <div class="tr"><span class="ph-name">出門帶一顆，能充幾次？</span><span class="cap">電池容量</span><span></span><span class="cnt2">充電次數</span></div>
        <div class="tr"><span class="ph-name">iPhone 15</span><span class="cap">3,349 mAh</span><span class="barwrap"><i class="seg" style="--f:1"></i><i class="seg" style="--f:.8"></i></span><span class="cnt2">約 1.8 次</span></div>
        <div class="tr"><span class="ph-name">iPhone 16</span><span class="cap">3,561 mAh</span><span class="barwrap"><i class="seg" style="--f:1"></i><i class="seg" style="--f:.7"></i></span><span class="cnt2">約 1.7 次</span></div>
        <div class="tr"><span class="ph-name">iPhone 17</span><span class="cap">3,692 mAh</span><span class="barwrap"><i class="seg" style="--f:1"></i><i class="seg" style="--f:.7"></i></span><span class="cnt2">約 1.7 次</span></div>
        <div class="tr"><span class="ph-name">Galaxy S26</span><span class="cap">4,300 mAh</span><span class="barwrap"><i class="seg" style="--f:1"></i><i class="seg" style="--f:.4"></i></span><span class="cnt2">約 1.4 次</span></div>
        <div class="tr"><span class="ph-name">Galaxy S26 Ultra</span><span class="cap">5,000 mAh</span><span class="barwrap"><i class="seg" style="--f:1"></i><i class="seg" style="--f:.2"></i></span><span class="cnt2">約 1.2 次</span></div>
        <div class="tr"><span class="ph-name">Pixel 10</span><span class="cap">4,970 mAh</span><span class="barwrap"><i class="seg" style="--f:1"></i><i class="seg" style="--f:.2"></i></span><span class="cnt2">約 1.2 次</span></div>
        <div class="tr"><span class="ph-name">Pixel 10 Pro</span><span class="cap">4,870 mAh</span><span class="barwrap"><i class="seg" style="--f:1"></i><i class="seg" style="--f:.3"></i></span><span class="cnt2">約 1.3 次</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="chgnote">充電次數以額定能量 37Wh、一般轉換效率約六成估算，實際依環境與使用狀況而異。手機電池容量為公開資料。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec device-charging" id="devices" aria-labelledby="devices-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="device-charging-head">
        <div><p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--ring)">一顆，多種裝置</p><h2 id="devices-title">手機能充。<br>AirPods 也能充。</h2></div>
        <p class="lede">磁吸放上就開始。從日常使用的手機，到支援無線充電的 AirPods 充電盒，一顆就能接手常用裝置的電力。</p>
      </header>
      <div class="device-charging-grid">
        <figure>
          <div class="devfig"><img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-phone-charging.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="穩如鈦山 Pro 為手機進行磁吸無線充電"></div>
          <figcaption><b>手機</b><span>Qi2.2 磁吸無線快充<br>最高 25W</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <div class="devfig"><img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-airpods-charging.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="穩如鈦山 Pro 為 AirPods 充電盒進行無線充電"></div>
          <figcaption><b>AirPods</b><span>支援無線充電盒<br>放上即可補電</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div></div>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "TSP charge", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
